OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,6,Fscattering of light showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping. However the odd brighter
OL,8,Fspell may break through during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds light from the west
OL,10,Fto northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FContinuing with mainly cloudy
OL,13,Fskies which occasionally thicken to
OL,14,Fbring a few light drizzly showers.
OL,15,FWinds light and variable in direction.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloudy for much of the day,
OL,18,Fbut any light showers are likely to be
OL,19,Frestricted to the morning. Some chance
OL,20,Fof brighter spells developing later in
OL,21,Fthe day. Winds light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
