OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FOccasional brighter spells breaking
OL,7,Fthrough. Mainly dry with only a few
OL,8,Flight showers appearing. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
